> > > Thanks Steve, that makes sense.  As you have probably guessed, I have to assess the power of a short time series to detect a decline.  The CV of the current (or future) abundance estimate is not likely to vary greatly as is appropriate for attempting this power analysis. You mention that an analysis performed using a known CV would have different results...  could you point me in the right direction as to what the appropriate method might be?
